ntains of Hauran, Wetzst Hauran 88 ); ב ׳אַלּוֺנֵי Zech 11:2 (figurative of prominent men); מִבּ ׳אַלּוֺנִים Ezek 27:6 ; of bulls ב ׳אַבִּידֵי Psa 22:13 (|| מָּרִים figurative); so ׳בְּנֵיבֿ Deut 32:14 (+ וְאֵילִים כָּרִים also עַתּוּדִים , compare בָּקָר & צאֹן v a ; see בֵּן 1. j. ( ν )); apparently more General is ב ׳מְרִיאֵי Ezek 39:18 (reference to כֻּלָּם ֗֗֗ מָּרִים וְעַתּוּדִים כָּרִים אֵילִים ); once of kine (feminine, figurative of luxurious and haughty women of Samaria) Amos 4:1 הַבּ ׳מָּרוֺת .","rootNote":"of uncertain derivation;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 5 11","keyReferences":["1Chr 5 11","1Chr 5 12","1Chr 5 16","1Chr 5 23","1Chr 6 47","1Chr 6 56","1Kgs 4 13","1Kgs 4 19"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":60,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 5 11","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/בָּשָׁ֖ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 5 12","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/בָּשָֽׁן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 5 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/בָּשָׁ֖ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 5 23","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִ/בָּשָׁ֞ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 6 47","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":47,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/בָּשָׁ֔ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 6 56","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":56,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/בָּשָׁ֖ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Np"},{"reference":"1Kgs 4 13","book":"1Kgs","chapter":4,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/בָּשָׁ֔ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Np"},{"reference":"1Kgs 4 19","book":"1Kgs","chapter":4,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/בָּשָׁ֔ן","source":"hebrew","morp